OL,3,AItalian jeweller and businessman Paolo 
OL,4,ABulgari dies aged 89                   
OL,6,FItalian jeweller Paolo Bulgari, who    
OL,7,Fhelped turn his family's business into 
OL,8,Fa global luxury brand, has died in Rome
OL,9,Faged age 89.                           
OL,11,FHis family announced the news,         
OL,12,Fremembering him as "the greatest       
OL,13,Fjeweller of our time", according to    
OL,14,FItalian media.                         
OL,16,FPaolo Bulgari was Chairman of the      
OL,17,FBvlgari Group since 1984 and its       
OL,18,Fjewellery pieces have adorned Hollywood
OL,19,Fstars and royalty including Diana,     
OL,20,FPrincess of Wales.                     
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
