OL,3,AItalian jeweller and businessman Paolo 
OL,4,ABulgari dies aged 89                   
OL,6,FThe company Bvlgari posted an online   
OL,7,Ftribute to the "true creative soul",   
OL,8,Fwhose work would "continue to inspire  
OL,9,Fgenerations to come".                  
